  "content": {
    "id": "p16-q14-response",
    "type": "question",
    "label": "14",
    "prompt": "A rectangular swimming pool, 12 m by 8 m, is surrounded by a concrete path of uniform width.\nIf the area of the path alone is 224 m², find its width.",
    "layout": "list",
    "columns": null,
    "questionDiagrams": [],
    "children": [],
    "answer": {
      "short": "$4\\text{ m}$. Solve $(12+2x)(8+2x)-96=224$, taking the positive root.",
      "worked": "Let $x$ metres be the width of the path. The outer dimensions are $(12+2x)$ m and $(8+2x)$ m.\n$$\\begin{align*}(2x+12)(2x+8)-224&=12\\times8\\\\4x^2+40x+96-224&=96\\\\4x^2+40x-224&=0\\\\x^2+10x-56&=0\\\\(x+14)(x-4)&=0\\\\x&=-14\\text{ or }4\\end{align*}$$\nSince $x>0$, the path is $4\\text{ m}$ wide.\nCheck: $(12+8)(8+8)-12\\times8=320-96=224\\text{ m}^2$.",
      "solutionDiagrams": []
    },
    "answerSpaceMm": 64
  },
